TITLE:: RCSynthDefs
summary:: SynthDef helpers for orgnsms
categories:: Libraries>reCurrent
related:: Classes/RCOrgnsm, Classes/RCFObject, Classes/RCLoopBuffer

CLASSMETHODS::
METHOD:: addForOrgnsms
Wraps a sound function (returning its signal) in an output stage and adds one SynthDef per possible number of outputs (code::name__1_out:: ... code::name__<maxNumOuts>_out::) so that a note can be spread over several fobject buses (code::\outs:: / code::\outamps::). A failing sound function is reported, not thrown.
argument:: name
argument:: soundFunc
argument:: offsetOut
argument:: oneOutputOnly
METHOD:: outputSuffix
METHOD:: maxNumOuts
METHOD:: addLoopBufferWriters
code::write_buffer_<n>chan:: SynthDefs for link::Classes/RCLoopBuffer::.
